==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*bez}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*bʰeǵʰ-}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|Ru-без.ogg|audio|lang=ru}}
* {{homophones|бес|lang=ru}}

===Preposition===
{{head|ru|preposition}} {{i|+ [[genitive case]]}}

# [[without]]
#: {{ru-ux|без [[вода|воды́]]|without water|inline=y}}
#: {{ru-ux|бе́зо [[всего́]]|without anything|inline=y}}
#: {{ru-ux|не без [[интерес|интере́са]]|not without interest|inline=y}}
#: {{ru-ux|без [[сомнение|сомне́ния]]|without doubt|inline=y}}
#: {{ru-ux|Не могу́ жить без тебя́|I can't live without you.}}
# [[minus]]
#: {{ru-ux|без [[четверть|че́тверти]] [[час]]|a quarter to one (lit., less a quarter one o’clock)|inline=y}}

====Usage Notes====
{{m|ru|бе́зо}} is used before some awkward consonant clusters.

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|без-}}

