==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*bez}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{m|ine-pro|*bʰeǵʰ-}}. Compare {{term|sc=Cyrl|без-|lang=sh}} and {{term|sc=Cyrl|бес-|lang=sh}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{qualifier|regional}}: {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|брез}}, {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|пре̏з}}, {{l|sh|preza}}

====Preposition====
{{sh-preposition|head=бѐз|c|bez|bèz}}

# {{context|with genitive|lang=sh}} [[without]], [[excluding]], not [[count]]ing
#: {{usex|без сумње|t=without a doubt|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|остати без нечега|t=to lose something, to run out of something, (literally: to stay without something)|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|без обзира на..|t=regardless of.., no matter what..is|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|без краја и конца|t=endlessly, without end|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|не без разлога|t=not without a reason|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|без срца|t=heartlessly, without a heart|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|без р(иј)ечи|t=without a word, speechless|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|бити без нечега|t=to be lacking in, to be deficient in, to lack (literally: to be without something)|lang=sh|inline=1}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|без-}}, {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|бес-}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|ota|sh}} {{term|tr=bez|lang=ota}}, from {{etyl|ar|sh}} {{term|tr=bäzz|lang=ar}}. Akin to {{term|sc=Cyrl|безистан|lang=sh}}, {{term|sc=Cyrl|безли|lang=sh}}, {{term|sc=Cyrl|бесофра|lang=sh}} and {{term|sc=Cyrl|беспара|lang=sh}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|/bêz/|lang=sh}}

====Noun====
{{sh-noun|g=m|head=бе̏з|c|bez|bȅz}}

# [[linen]], [[canvas]]
# {{context|specifically|lang=sh}} a type of [[cotton]]-made [[linen]] or [[canvas]] used in Oriental [[costume]]s, of several possible forms: {{term|sc=Cyrl|ћереће|lang=sh}}, {{term|sc=Cyrl|седелук|lang=sh}}, {{term|kafez|lang=sh}} or {{term|sc=Cyrl|кафез-без|lang=sh}}, {{term|sc=Cyrl|мелез|lang=sh}}, {{term|sc=Cyrl|харир|lang=sh}}, {{term|sc=Cyrl|шејтанбез|lang=sh}} and {{term|sc=Cyrl|харирбез|lang=sh}}.

